  "description": "Elm-architecture TUI framework for .NET 8. Immutable model → pure update → declarative view. 13 built-in widgets, 6 themes, mouse support, Unicode-aware layout, composable IComponent sub-programs, and a double-buffered ANSI renderer with per-widget dirty tracking.",
